[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Quodlibet has been installed.
For the plugins to work, the following ports are required.
* notification plugin
  A DBus notification daemon like sysutils/dunst or x11/mako
* replaygain plugin
  multimedia/gstreamer1-plugins-good
* acoustid plugin
  multimedia/gstreamer1-plugins-bad
* "Browse Folders" and others
  devel/py-dbus
* MQTT plugin
  net/py-paho-mqtt
* Musicbrainz plugin
  audio/py-musicbrainzngs
* Sonos plugin
  multimedia/py-soco
EOM
}
]
